elated-article related-article-type="corrected-article" vol="172" page="999" id="N0x1bd3550N0x3400ea0" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="16549501" ext-link-type="pubmed">999&#x02013;1008</related-article>.</p><p>After publication of this manuscript, the authors noticed that two images (Fig. 4 B, top left and middle) had been duplicated from a previous publication (Holway, A.H., C. Hung, and W.M. Michael. 2005. <italic>Genetics</italic>. 169:1451&#x02013;1460). Here we provide new images corresponding to these control experiments. The authors apologize for this oversight.</p><fig position="anchor" id="fig1"><label>Figure 1</label><graphic xlink:href="jcb1780887f01"></graphic></fig></body></article>